{"id":"B1-L011","title":"want someone to do — use","cefr":"B1","level":"B1","unit":"B1-U01","focus":"want someone to do — uso","targets":{"grammar":"want someone to do — uso","pron":"Entonação","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["school meeting","reading progress","teacher report","formal request","parent email","school support","follow-up","polite tone","subject line","kind regards","reading level","extra class","head teacher","family contact","meeting time","parent request","school letter","reading tutor"],"field":"Educação","genre":"E-mail, carta, mensagem","skill":"Fala","words_min":18},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 11 · want someone to do — use","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** want someone to do — uso.","**Pronúncia:** Entonação.","**18 palavras novas** (educação).","**Texto do dia:** e-mail, carta, mensagem."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B1):** eu consigo usar want/ask/tell/expect + objeto + to numa carta formal."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["school meeting","reunião escolar"],["reading progress","progresso na leitura"],["teacher report","relatório do professor"],["formal request","pedido formal"],["parent email","e-mail de pais"],["school support","apoio escolar"],["follow-up","acompanhamento"],["polite tone","tom educado"],["subject line","assunto"],["kind regards","atenciosamente"],["reading level","nível de leitura"],["extra class","aula extra"],["head teacher","diretora"],["family contact","contato da família"],["meeting time","horário da reunião"],["parent request","parent request"],["school letter","school letter"],["reading tutor","reading tutor"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An e-mail","blocks":[{"type":"mail","from":"ana@mail.com","to":"school@mail.com","subject":"Request for a meeting","paras":["Dear Ms. Reyes,","I would like **you to meet** me this week. I want **my son to improve** his reading, and I expect **the school to support** him. Could you ask **his teacher to send** me a report?","Thank you. Ana Costa"],"gloss":[["improve","melhorar"],["support","apoiar"],["report","relatório"],["meet","reunir-se"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Ana wants a meeting.","ans":"T","why":"meet me this week."},{"q":"Ana wants her son to stop reading.","ans":"F","why":"improve his reading."},{"q":"Ana asks for a report.","ans":"T","why":"send me a report."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“support” (verbo) = ?","opts":["apoiar","suportar só","supor"],"ans":0,"why":"support."},{"q":"“report” = ?","opts":["relatório","relato","retrato"],"ans":0,"why":"report."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"want someone to do: use","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verbo","Exemplo"],"rows":[["would like","**I would like you to meet me.**"],["want","**I want my son to improve.**"],["expect","**I expect the school to support him.**"],["ask","**Could you ask his teacher to send a report?**"]],"cap":"want someone to do: use"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Em e-mails formais, **would like … to** soa mais educado que *want … to*."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I would like you ___ meet me. (to)","a":"to","why":"would like."},{"s":"I want my son ___ improve. (to)","a":"to","why":"want."},{"s":"I expect the school ___ support him. (to)","a":"to","why":"expect."},{"s":"Could you ask his teacher ___ send a report? (to)","a":"to","why":"ask."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["school meeting","reunião escolar"],["reading progress","progresso na leitura"],["teacher report","relatório do professor"],["formal request","pedido formal"],["parent email","e-mail de pais"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["to","help","We'll","ask","his","tutor"],"ans":"We'll ask his tutor to help","pt":"Vamos pedir ao tutor que ajude."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"school meeting","pos":"word","pt":"reunião escolar","ex":"A school meeting.","expt":"Uma reunião escolar."},{"w":"reading progress","pos":"word","pt":"progresso na leitura","ex":"Reading progress.","expt":"Progresso na leitura."},{"w":"teacher report","pos":"word","pt":"relatório do professor","ex":"A teacher report.","expt":"Um relatório do professor."},{"w":"formal request","pos":"word","pt":"pedido formal","ex":"A formal request.","expt":"Um pedido formal."},{"w":"parent email","pos":"word","pt":"e-mail de pais","ex":"A parent email.","expt":"Um e-mail de pais."},{"w":"school support","pos":"word","pt":"apoio escolar","ex":"School support.","expt":"Apoio escolar."},{"w":"follow-up","pos":"word","pt":"acompanhamento","ex":"A follow-up.","expt":"Um acompanhamento."},{"w":"polite tone","pos":"word","pt":"tom educado","ex":"A polite tone.","expt":"Um tom educado."},{"w":"subject line","pos":"word","pt":"assunto","ex":"A subject line.","expt":"Um assunto."},{"w":"kind regards","pos":"word","pt":"atenciosamente","ex":"Kind regards.","expt":"Atenciosamente."},{"w":"reading level","pos":"word","pt":"nível de leitura","ex":"A reading level.","expt":"Um nível de leitura."},{"w":"extra class","pos":"word","pt":"aula extra","ex":"An extra class.","expt":"Uma aula extra."},{"w":"head teacher","pos":"word","pt":"diretora","ex":"The head teacher.","expt":"A diretora."},{"w":"family contact","pos":"word","pt":"contato da família","ex":"A family contact.","expt":"Um contato da família."},{"w":"meeting time","pos":"word","pt":"horário da reunião","ex":"A meeting time.","expt":"Um horário de reunião."},{"w":"parent request","pos":"word","pt":"parent request","ex":"pedido de pais","expt":"Parent request."},{"w":"school letter","pos":"word","pt":"school letter","ex":"carta da escola","expt":"School letter."},{"w":"reading tutor","pos":"word","pt":"reading tutor","ex":"tutor de leitura","expt":"Reading tutor."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**I look forward to hearing from you.** — Aguardo seu retorno.","**Please let me know.** — Por favor, me avise.","**At your convenience.** — Quando for conveniente.","**We’ll ask his tutor to help.** — Vamos pedir ao tutor que ajude.","**I would like you to meet me this week.** — Gostaria que se reunisse comigo esta semana.","**Of course. What would you like to discuss?** — Claro. O que gostaria de discutir?","**Jump on the bandwagon.** — Aderir à moda.","**Miss the boat.** — Perder a oportunidade."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"damage","pt":"danificar","forms":[["I / you / we / they damage","Rain damages roofs."],["he / she / it damages","It damages the car."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"At school","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"At school","lines":[["Ana","I would like you to meet me this week.","Gostaria que se reunisse comigo esta semana."],["Teacher","Of course. What would you like to discuss?","Claro. O que gostaria de discutir?"],["Ana","I want my son to improve his reading.","Quero que meu filho melhore a leitura."],["Teacher","We’ll ask his tutor to help.","Vamos pedir ao tutor que ajude."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Entonação","items":[{"label":"Entonação","note":"Perguntas de sim/não sobem; Wh- descem; listas sobem e descem no fim; dúvida sobe.","words":["Have you ever studied abroad? ↗","Where did you study? ↘","books, notes, and pens ↘"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Make a polite request with would like.","pt":"Peça.","model":"I would like you to send me a report."},{"q":"Say what you expect.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I expect the school to help."},{"q":"Ask someone to ask someone.","pt":"Peça.","model":"Could you ask him to call me?"}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 6-line formal e-mail with verb + object + to.","model":"Dear Ms. Reyes, I would like you to meet me this week. I want my son to improve his reading. I expect the school to support him. Could you ask his teacher to send me a report? Thank you for your time. Kind regards, Ana Costa","checklist":["Usei **would like … to**","Usei **ask / expect**","Tom formal"],"words":"6 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “school meeting” mean?","opts":["progresso na leitura","reunião escolar","pedido formal"],"ans":1,"why":"**school meeting** = reunião escolar."},{"q":"What does “reading progress” mean?","opts":["relatório do professor","e-mail de pais","progresso na leitura"],"ans":2,"why":"**reading progress** = progresso na leitura."},{"q":"What does “teacher report” mean?","opts":["relatório do professor","pedido formal","apoio escolar"],"ans":0,"why":"**teacher report** = relatório do professor."},{"q":"What does “formal request” mean?","opts":["e-mail de pais","pedido formal","horário de atendimento"],"ans":1,"why":"**formal request** = pedido formal."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}